        "text": "theorem force_tsupport_subset {f : VelocityField} {K : Set Space}\n    (hK : IsCompact K) (hf : ∀ t x, x ∉ K → f (t, x) = 0) :\n    tsupport (force f) ⊆ Icc (1 / 16 : ℝ) (21 / 16) ×ˢ K"
